y-panel"><div class="candidate-panel-head"><div class="candidate-panel-title-row"><h3>RECENT COVERAGE TREND</h3><span class="candidate-section-info-wrap candidate-panel-info-wrap"><button class="candidate-section-info" type="button" aria-label="Recent coverage trend information" aria-describedby="media-history-note">i</button><span class="candidate-section-tooltip" id="media-history-note" role="tooltip">Daily share of election + campaign articles associated with Marine Le Pen. The series covers 29 complete UTC days and does not measure support, approval, sentiment or voting intention.</span></span></div><span>29 complete days · UTC</span></div><div class="candidate-panel-body"><div class="candidate-chart candidate-media-history-chart" data-chart="media-history" role="group" aria-label="Recent history of Marine Le Pen&#x27;s daily coverage share"><p class="candidate-chart-fallback">Published history from 14 Oct 2026 to 11 Nov 2026.</p></div></div></article>\n        <article class="candidate-panel candidate-media-structure-panel"><div class="candidate-panel-head"><h3>COVERAGE STRUCTURE</h3></div><div class="candidate-panel-body"><div class="candidate-media-structure"><section class="candidate-media-structure-module candidate-media-scope-module"><h4>SCOPE</h4><div class="candidate-media-scope-grid"><div class="candidate-media-scope-item candidate-media-scope-election"><div class="candidate-media-scope-head"><span>ELECTION</span><strong>89.7%</strong></div><span class="candidate-media-scope-meta">61 articles</span><span class="candidate-media-structure-track" aria-hidden="true"><span style="--structure-share:0.897"></span></span></div><div class="candidate-media-scope-item candidate-media-scope-campaign"><div class="candidate-media-scope-head"><span>CAMPAIGN</span><strong>10.3%</strong></div><span class="candidate-media-scope-meta">7 articles</span><span class="candidate-media-structure-track" aria-hidden="true"><span style="--structure-share:0.103"></span></span></div