cusable="false"><g aria-hidden="true"><circle class="candidate-public-signal-trend-point" cx="4.00" cy="37.00" r="1.5"/><polyline class="candidate-chart-line" points="34.31,31.00 43.71,28.00 52.67,28.00 61.72,25.00 70.56,25.00 79.71,22.00 89.66,19.00 98.47,19.00 108.00,16.00 117.06,16.00 126.08,16.00 134.90,16.00 144.35,13.00 154.84,13.00 163.06,13.00 172.25,13.00 181.36,10.00 190.30,10.00 198.98,10.00 208.17,10.00 218.92,7.00 227.19,7.00 236.00,7.00"/><circle class="candidate-chart-point candidate-public-signal-current" cx="236.00" cy="7.00" r="2.2"/></g></svg><p class="candidate-public-signal-support">Recent activity incomplete</p><a class="candidate-source-link" href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCU3z3px1_RCqYBwrs8LJVWg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">YouTube channel ↗</a></div></article><article class="candidate-panel candidate-public-signal" data-provider="bluesky" data-state="unavailable" aria-labelledby="public-signal-bluesky-title"><header class="candidate-panel-head"><div class="candidate-panel-title-row"><h3 id="public-signal-bluesky-title">Bluesky</h3><span class="candidate-section-info-wrap candidate-panel-info-wrap"><button class="candidate-section-info" type="button" aria-label="Method and provenance — Bluesky" aria-describedby="public-signal-bluesky-note">i</button><span class="candidate-section-tooltip" id="public-signal-bluesky-note" role="tooltip">Reviewed personal/campaign account established from first-party sources. The DID is the persistent identity; the handle may change. Official-account followers on Bluesky, not voters or a measure of support. Public-web visibility opt-outs are respected. Change compares the current value with the latest valid observation at or before seven days earlier. Insufficient history produces no change or chart. Change in Bluesky follower count. Up to 30 days of actual time-spaced observations; missing UTC dates break the line, short runs use dots, the current value is ringed. Sparse coverage hides the